            "description": "",
            "summary": "Enpro (NPO) posted net profit margins of 7.8%, up from 5.2% previously, and has compounded earnings at an impressive 33.5% annually over the past five years. Recent earnings growth reached 59.7% and is forecast to continue at 26.8% per year, easily outpacing the broader US market. While profit momentum remains strong, management\u2019s continued alignment and lack of major insider selling further support the investment case. Investors are weighing both a premium valuation and moderating revenue...",
